Body:
This issue might be a duplicate of an existing issue. Please check:
- #23193: Same error (`eager_input_streaming: Extra inputs are not permitted`) with `claude-haiku-4.5` via GitHub Copilot — already has a fix in progress.

In the meantime, a workaround from the collaborator on that issue:

```json
"provider": {
  "github-copilot": {
    "models": {
      "claude-haiku-4.5": {
        "options": {
          "toolStreaming": false
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

Add this to your OpenCode config file to work around the issue until the fix is released.
